Subject: [PATCH 1954/3799] soh: rename D_80126184 -> sHookshotAimOffset

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: hand-space point transformed into Player.unk_3C8 while the hookshot or longshot is drawn; the field's meaning is not established, so the aim reading is inferred from the reticle branch it sits in
Defined in soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c b/soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c
index fb3f41573..e5f61308a 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c
@@ -1786,7 +1786,8 @@ Vec3f sRightHandLimbModelShieldQuadVertices[] = {
     { 1500.0f, 3000.0f, -600.0f },
 };
 
-Vec3f D_80126184 = { 100.0f, 1500.0f, 0.0f };
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was D_80126184: hand-space point transformed into Player.unk_3C8 while the hookshot or longshot is drawn; the field's meaning is not established, so the aim reading is inferred from the reticle branch it sits in
+Vec3f sHookshotAimOffset = { 100.0f, 1500.0f, 0.0f };  // was D_80126184 [LLM:GUESS]
 Vec3f D_80126190 = { 100.0f, 1640.0f, 0.0f };
 
 Vec3f sSheathLimbModelShieldQuadVertices[] = {
@@ -1954,7 +1955,7 @@ void Player_PostLimbDrawGameplay(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Ve
                                       (this->heldItemAction == PLAYER_IA_HOOKSHOT) ||
                                           (this->heldItemAction == PLAYER_IA_LONGSHOT),
                                       this)) {
-                Matrix_MultVec3f(&D_80126184, &this->unk_3C8);
+                Matrix_MultVec3f(&sHookshotAimOffset, &this->unk_3C8);  // was D_80126184 [LLM:GUESS]
 
                 if (heldActor != NULL) {
                     MtxF sp44;
